{
  "name": "bench-cases-index",
  "label": "长流程用例包的用例清单（jq -r，一行一个）",
  "transport": {
    "client": "cli",
    "url_template": "bench/cases-live-long.json",
    "note": "真实命令行工具：jq 从 JSON 文件里抽一行一个 id，按行解析",
    "cli": {
      "bin": "jq",
      "argv": [
        "-r",
        ".cases[].id",
        "{url}"
      ],
      "cwd": ".",
      "exit_ok": [
        0
      ]
    },
    "version_pin": "jq-1.",
    "version_argv": [
      "--version"
    ]
  },
  "extract": {
    "kind": "lines_regex",
    "fields": {
      "id": "^(.+)$"
    }
  },
  "counts": [
    {
      "key": "cases",
      "label": "用例数"
    }
  ],
  "audits": [
    {
      "key": "no_id",
      "label": "缺 id 行",
      "field": "id",
      "empty": true
    }
  ],
  "report": {
    "title": "长流程用例清单（jq）",
    "source_note": "`jq -r '.cases[].id' bench/cases-live-long.json`（`transport.client = cli`）；`{url}` 是输入文件路径",
    "preview": {
      "columns": [
        "id"
      ],
      "limit": 10
    },
    "notes": [
      "同一条 CLI 通道既能抽行文本（这里），也能抽整个 JSON 文档（见 bench-cases-shape.json）。",
      "把仓库里的一份**受版本控制的产物**当输入，所以这条 source 的期望值是确定的。"
    ]
  }
}
